        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Almost every mower that will not start in April was killed by fuel in December. An hour now is the difference between a machine that fires on the second pull and a carburettor rebuild.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
